usage: finalize_bundle.py [-h] --spec SPEC --builder BUILDER --context CONTEXT
                          --finite-smoke FINITE_SMOKE --ieantn-run IEANTN_RUN
                          --accepted-source-root ACCEPTED_SOURCE_ROOT
                          --native-cc NATIVE_CC --native-cpu NATIVE_CPU
                          --katex KATEX --out OUT

Execute reviewed archival, 6 MB splitting and extracted artifact checks. This
runs no Lean proof compilation and makes no new mathematical acceptance claim.
The caller supplies an independently reviewed exact bundle specification.
Reports and FINAL_STATUS must already be approved inputs of that
specification. Original packets, accepted runs and downloaded parts are never
modified.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --spec SPEC
  --builder BUILDER
  --context CONTEXT
  --finite-smoke FINITE_SMOKE
  --ieantn-run IEANTN_RUN
  --accepted-source-root ACCEPTED_SOURCE_ROOT
  --native-cc NATIVE_CC
  --native-cpu NATIVE_CPU
  --katex KATEX
  --out OUT
